{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（9月1日）上午10時許，警方接報，深水埗元州街15A號元州中心懷疑電線起火。消防到場將火救熄。事件中無人受傷及無需疏散。</p><p>現場消息指，懷疑因電線短路導致火警發生。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防開喉灌救。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260901/1171412044717887488201864.jpeg/SZU_Pwu3nVw0OZlvXdc905vv6Q_iK3KUICw69gUsOvY\"/><figcaption>消防開喉灌救。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防開喉灌救。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260901/1171412042226339840296810.jpeg/EbqylDrQNoz8xQY-hQFnfyEAv7gsEtWD5fl7bMD5e2w\"/><figcaption>消防開喉灌救。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260901/1171412039667683328385249.jpeg/Id0mQ5GSoFaPUnzvsiGmXmkL785MjbTivyZGZZomRmU\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為深水埗元州街15A號元州中心。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260901/1171412036790259712684517.jpeg/5ST8HgCoQn72VK0_ckZJRdS8TweZPUNDTZBTb2iQU28\"/><figcaption>現場為深水埗元州街15A號元州中心。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T03:21:00.134096+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}